# ── ~/Obsidian project conventions (added 2026-09-27, fork) ─────────────────
#
# The lines above are upstream's. These are ours, and they match the sibling
# projects under ~/Obsidian so a session behaves the same in every vault.

# macOS and editor noise
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Scratch. `_tmp/` is where a session puts anything that is not the work:
# patch bundles, extracted text, a copy of something being diffed. Nothing in
# it is precious; empty it whenever.
_tmp/
_to_delete/
_staging/
*.bak

# The Claude desktop app creates `Claude outputs/` at the root of whatever
# folder a session has connected, and drops a copy of every file delivered
# into the chat there. `~/Obsidian/sync-repos.command` trashes it on each run.
Claude outputs/

wishlist.md